  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C to F: x &times; 9/5 + 32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F to C: (x &minus; 32) &times; 5/9</p>\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius &rarr; Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit &rarr; Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n    <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n    <p class=\"result-label\">Result</p>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #8a8a9e;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #1a1a2e 25%, #0f0f1a 25%, #0f0f1a 50%, #1a1a2e 50%, #1a1a2e 75%, #0f0f1a 75%);\n  background-size: 32px 32px;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;\n  padding: 24px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.formula {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-align: center;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\nlabel {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--muted);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n}\nbutton {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ff5c7a; border-color: #ff5c7a; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); box-shadow: none; }\n.result-label {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px dashed var(--muted);\n  color: var(--accent);\n  min-height: 3.5rem;\n}\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.1rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  var input = document.getElementById('temperature');\n  var direction = document.getElementById('direction');\n  var button = document.getElementById('convert');\n  var result = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function convert() {\n    var raw = input.value.trim();\n    if (raw === '') {\n      result.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    var x = Number(raw);\n    if (!isFinite(x)) {\n      result.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    var out;\n    if (direction.value === 'c-to-f') {\n      out = x * 9 / 5 + 32;\n    } else {\n      out = (x - 32) * 5 / 9;\n    }\n    result.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  button.addEventListener('click', convert);\n  input.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n      convert();\n    }\n  });\n  direction.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n      convert();\n    }\n  });\n})();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nAn offline, single-page pixel-style temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript. No packages, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a numeric temperature in the **Temperature** field.\n3. Choose a direction:\n   - `c-to-f` — Celsius to Fahrenheit\n   - `f-to-c` — Fahrenheit to Celsius\n4. Click **Convert** (or press Enter).\n5. The result appears in the output area with exactly two decimals and no units.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `F = C * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `C = (F - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf the input is empty, non-numeric, or non-finite (e.g. `Infinity`), the output shows exactly `Error`.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and labeled controls\n- `styles.css` — pixel-themed responsive styling\n- `script.js` — conversion logic and event listeners\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls have associated labels.\n- Keyboard navigation and Enter-to-convert are supported.\n- Visible focus, hover and pressed states.\n\n## Offline\n\nNo external assets, imports, iframes or server code. Works fully offline.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
